    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>S2E13: 推特杀手—座间9人杀害事件</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【主播】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>肖恩, Jesse</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>2017年秋天，日本神奈川县座间市的一间小公寓里，隐藏着令人震惊的黑暗秘密。直到10月30日，警方为寻找一名失踪女性展开调查时，这一连环杀人案才被揭开。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这名23岁的东京女性突然失联，引起了家人的担忧。警方循着她的社交媒体线索，最终锁定了一个位于座间市绿丘六丁目的男子。当警察进入他的房间时，却发现了令人难以置信的一幕：9具被肢解的尸体，堆放在他仅10平方米左右的房间里。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music for echo investigation volume2/2-TJK</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>粉丝群，添加微信：tianjiakai</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家留言/发邮件/私信主播提供有趣的题材和故事，或者对我们的节目提出宝贵的建议，</span><a href="mailto:%E9%82%AE%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%B7%E6%8A%95%E9%80%92%E5%88%B0echoinvestigation@163.com"><u><span>邮件请投递到echoinvestigation@163.com</span></u></a><u><span>、</span></u></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp9nnIZDnXodT2hPwLKzKUmIJ6wQ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>座间市的向日葵花海</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqPmX0WJMLuOSDgA3oUmdBCKr1rQ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkqthBgFcYTR81oQ1ILtq1KBU8YX.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>白石隆浩</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlNrnfcY3eGLWSnVxcu46TmfmvvZ.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>白石隆浩行凶的公寓</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjf_2oYZxtMJ9HTaVcEHGze2eN3b.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>白石隆浩的推特账号</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgtQNefi_vXNaMyG7vjVK0rQUxQc.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>白石隆浩</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl5MieYfJxLUP18iBisKsvvRhY-f.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>白石隆浩庭审画像</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>资料来源：</span></strong></