    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>S2E12: 她消失在了阿鲁巴岛上—娜塔莉·霍洛威失踪案</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【主播】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>肖恩, Jesse,</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>18岁的美国妙龄女生与一百多名同学在加勒比海岛上共同进行毕业旅行，但是到了回程时她却迟迟没有出现，而这一别，时至今日仍下落不明。这一事件造成了全美国的轰动，甚至引发了严重的外交冲突。警方在早早就锁定的嫌疑人的情况下却迟迟未能将其定罪，直到去年，这起20年的悬案终于有了答案。这究竟发生了什么？让我们走进今天的回声探案。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music for echo investigation volume2/2-TJK</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>粉丝群，添加微信：tianjiakai</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家留言/发邮件/私信主播提供有趣的题材和故事，或者对我们的节目提出宝贵的建议，</span><a href="mailto:%E9%82%AE%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%B7%E6%8A%95%E9%80%92%E5%88%B0echoinvestigation@163.com"><u><span>邮件请投递到echoinvestigation@163.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiwJ6P5gpOzNDT6DcPrqDdLlPBc2.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmmZiPLMPZ3CPyyG7pF0IWiCdd7-.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv3VfxBpfgG-OB-Jk3iCvVRtuuV7.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Natalee Ann Holloway</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr4cVyjF0DpZOwqJlLCz6ZTTtYxE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Natalee及其同学所住的假日酒店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fir0r2jzWECUKNxBhqQGLp0U8ac8.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Carlos’n Charlie’s夜总会</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgncUhDuqEuKRVkz61R_gH2aBoil.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Joran van der Sloot</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp3v65BozyxjHFlEGhowbIvmSycq.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>荷兰军方于加利福尼亚灯塔附近搜索</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu5g9OcfsxHlBXEzbDdOzgkgjA1u.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Joran在Natalee失踪后飞到纽约接受ABC现场采访，采访中他表示当时他把Natalee独自一人留在了沙滩上。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgK0UbZD7h-XMokktjpyTMOo-V_R.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Natalee的母亲Beth</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpYYHt432loQsbbpQ_HCq0nFjPay.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>2012年被逮捕并等待听证会的Joran</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuRs_d0gQgpqqsyzV4gMBI9LUSwc.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>被定罪的Joran</span></p><span></span><p><span>图片及资料来源</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://abcnews.go.com/International/natalee-holloways-disappearance-remains-unsolved-15-years-timeline/story?id=67135012" data-url="https://abcnews.go.com/International/natalee-holloways-disappearance-remains-unsolved-15-years-timeline/story?id=67135012"><u><span>abcnews.go.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disappearance_of_Natalee_Holloway" data-url="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disappearance_of_Natalee_Holloway"><u><span>en.wikipedia.org</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.foxnews.com/us/twenty-years-after-natalee-holloway-vanished-suspects-confession-still-leaves-questions-pi" data-url="https://www.foxnews.com/us/twenty-years-after-natalee-holloway-vanished-suspects-confession-still-leaves-questions-pi"><span>www.foxnews.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>感谢【七 西 品 牌】对本期节目的支持。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目推荐【七西小蝴蝶按摩腰靠】适合肩颈酸痛、久坐或操劳导致的腰酸背痛、运动后需要舒压放松的人士。新款小蝴蝶按照人体工学设计，更加贴合身体曲线，对肩颈腰背都能精准按摩。充电款使用方便，无论是居还是办公都能随时随地深度释压。仿人手按摩，手法不输按摩店老师傅。不管自用或是送礼都是好选择。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【听友福利】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>点击链接：</span><a href="https://mo.m.tmall.com/page/36178658?shop_id=521104390" data-url="https://mo.m.tmall.com/page/36178658?shop_id=521104390"><span>mo.m.tmall.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>或复制口令到淘宝￥LvmEVJeJyvH￥CZ0001/</span></p><span></span><p><span>或去淘店搜【七 西 旗 舰 店】向客服报暗号“回声探案”领取比⑥①⑧大促更低价的优惠！</span></p><span></span><p><span>另外回声探案听友们还有特别惊喜：</span></p><span></span><p><span>除了小蝴蝶按摩腰靠之外，还帮大家申请了七西的全店福利，需要更换床品的听友们，也可以进入淘店选择无压枕、夏凉被和纳凉垫，三款床品满两件即享95折优惠。凉被凉垫同时叠加国补更划算。有需要的听友们都可以了解尝试。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgMjjLcBSswkH1FOqTzYAOBxYdTt.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlXiSN3y3IH4CSDYpMPKLmwLaV3L.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo3STpDC-s7aXFVl2svXpmWe8npL.png"></figure>]]></description>
