    <title>S2E11: 英雄还是恶棍，当代罗宾汉还是小丑？联合保险总裁被刺案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ee867c0decaeb094c26252</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67ee867c0decaeb094c26252</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 03 Apr 2025 13:01:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>S2E11: 英雄还是恶棍，当代罗宾汉还是小丑？ 联合保险总裁被刺案</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【主播】：Jesse, 肖恩</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】：2024年12月4日早上<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">6:45</a>，时任全球第二大保险公司联合健康保险公司的CEO布赖恩·汤普森正要去参加年度投资者会议，此时他身后一名身穿黑色连帽衫男子从他背后慢慢接近，接着拿出手枪向他连开数枪，随后逃之夭夭，而汤普森随后被送往医院不治身亡。随后凶手被逮捕，但是他却如同英雄一般受到了民众广泛支持，称其为当代罗宾汉，这到底是怎么一回事？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmRCahyFbezz7onW0Bs5ykmYGkGP.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>联合健康CEO Brian Thompson</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FufGekaeZ5n6Ba1IVmf_m2M7jOUc.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>1.凶手行凶前在星巴克短暂停留</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.凶手开枪杀死被害人</span></p><span></span><p><span>3.凶手逃入小巷子并骑上共享单车</span></p><span></span><p><span>4.凶手进入纽约中央公园</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk4AI8_jSM41lvcBWiPdxoyLUpTK.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Luigi Mangione 生活照</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpyrzdGJ6-swBnKuJrcrmFA8gOkQ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>移送</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrMR3NZN0ANg7OvIsXprEBRCvxMC.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>庭审</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqpvxPjMveEgrMkoE8zHMeeWtJyT.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>2025年4月1日最新消息，美国司法部长邦迪表示，她已指示纽约曼哈顿代理联邦检察官马修·波多尔斯基在接下来的审判程序中，对枪杀联合健康首席执行官的嫌疑人路易吉·曼吉奥内判处死刑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>信息和图片来源</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://edition.cnn.com/us/crime-and-justice" data-url="https://edition.cnn.com/us/crime-and-justice"><u><span>edition.cnn.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/apr/01/luigi-mangione-death-penalty-united-healthcare-brian-thompson-killing" data-url="https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/apr/01/luigi-mangione-death-penalty-united-healthcare-brian-thompson-killing"><u><span>www.theguardian.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cvgpl2qn7l5o" data-url="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cvgpl2qn7l5o"><span>www.bbc.co.uk</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music for echo investigation volume 2/2-TJK</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>粉丝群，添加微信：tianjiakai</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家留言/发邮件/私信主播提供有趣的题材和故事，或者对我们的节目提出宝贵的建议，邮件请投递到echoinvestigation@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
