    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>S2E08: 消失的半具尸体</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【主播】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>肖恩, Jesse</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1996年6月22日， 19岁的Karina Holmer跟朋友在波士顿市中心的一家夜店外有说有笑，可是这也是最后一次有人见到还活着的她；没过几天，她的尸体就被人在垃圾堆里发现，而更可怖的是，她的身体被锯成两截，现场只发现了上半身，Karina 的下半身至此无影无踪，究竟发生了什么?让我们走进回声探案的第二季第八集：消失的半具尸体---Karina Holmer谋杀案</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgMxO-bRZDKUJyPmLxc-lReb-lM1.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Karina Holmer</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FllEvkEoOHWifgahQvkXk6ibHtAp.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>在Zanzibar的Karina</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmG7mZWmIYKSmEgMwjXgLqxD_cCj.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>发现尸体上半身的垃圾箱（现场拍照，非摄像头录像）</span></p><span></span><p><span>资料来源：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://coldcasene.org/f/karina-holmer" data-url="https://coldcasene.org/f/karina-holmer"><span>coldcasene.org</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.talkmurderwithme.com/blog/2018/11/18/the-murder-of-karina-holmer" data-url="https://www.talkmurderwithme.com/blog/2018/11/18/the-murder-of-karina-holmer"><span>www.talkmurderwithme.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music for echo investigation volume2/2-TJK</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>粉丝群，添加微信：tianjiakai</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家留言/发邮件/私信主播提供有趣的题材和故事，或者对我们的节目提出宝贵的建议，邮件请投递到echoinvestigation@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
