    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>S2E05:沙丘女士</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【主播】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jesse, 肖恩</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>50年前有一具女尸在马萨诸塞州的一个沙丘被人意外发现，在接近半个世纪的时间里，无数的人员想要确认她的身份，但都不了了之。直到2022年新的调查报告揭开了这位女尸的真实身份，随之而来的，也使得真凶浮出水面……</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music for echo investigation volume2/2-TJK</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>粉丝群，添加微信：tianjiakai</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家留言/发邮件/私信主播提供有趣的题材和故事，或者对我们的节目提出宝贵的建议，邮件请投递到echoinvestigation@163.com</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp9QZio1Q0Dq836Py4ZOvFxAMQxH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>By Andrew Wyeth（Jesse提到的那幅画）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiZzRI8DUKPI2lBhOiQ0htS8ra3D.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Provincetown位于马萨诸塞州的东北方向</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtyOP291yFJ350O_Yqi6kA5vh5wW.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>现在的Provincetown</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu8UdozQBuZoeLOeYCqBxGHK52jz.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>科德角或鳕鱼角</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq-NMaeHouMDVf2THs61OijQ077Y.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>“沙丘女士”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkKHdcoN76XNlNd-lh4Z3PFBdz4N.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>1979-2006年间警方所绘制的死者可能长相</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmQvt1tQ8Wux2wM9R2mr6VPKpXST.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Ruth Marie Terry</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn-QbT82jf_l_5ZSfqbNIaNWEVxC.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Guy Rockwell Muldavin</span></p><span></span><p><span>图片来源：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:View_of_Provincetown_from_Pilgrim_Monument_looking_east,_MA,_USA_-_Sept,_2013.jpg" data-url="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:View_of_Provincetown_from_Pilgrim_Monument_looking_east,_MA,_USA_-_Sept,_2013.jpg"><span>commons.wikimedia.org</span></a></p>]]></description>
