    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Mar 2024 10:34:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>S2E04: 日本悬赏金额最高的案件——世田谷一家灭门事件</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【主播】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>肖恩, Jesse</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期所讲的案件发生地点是位于日本东京都的世田谷区，该区是东京都的特别区当中面积第二大的区，也是全日本人口最多的区,现今人口已接近100万，该区以其环境良好的高端住宅而闻名。而就是在这么一个中高产阶层居住的地区却发生了一起日本悬赏金额最高的刑事案件。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music for echo investigation volume1/2-TJK</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo9hnq4iIhcUus2HUr3J-QqLwL7t.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>政府发布的寻找嫌疑人的海报</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhz496DCrzDKp57F0oOQoGr0HsXF.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>干男、泰子一家四口</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg-L6oQAVgpLexwj0xH0wPJWfnfd.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>泰子与入江杏两家的房屋（右边房屋为泰子一家，左边为入江杏一家）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhS3Aonh3YmxTyFMF_EvRPEEA32i.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>案发现场图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnvEdCMZ6XqKg19nJKujNu--czi-.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>一楼通往二楼的楼梯，右手边楼梯下为发现干男尸体处</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fro0tUtLfsb72Xfg_EyDQHmL6uPh.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>凶手形象图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnmp50ay7Ow5gqO70NPWp_9weLFy.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>凶手进出现场示意图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1YnuThUf17WMnF7oxiXRPbr2Uu.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>泰子姐姐入江杏在妮娜和小礼的窗前</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpvjxAWPlcXazs8gTB-EOYBQzHaf.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>一家生前照片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk59LU77biWaCeDyU9nyq5rwLKUQ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>警视厅网上征集线索的简体中文版海报</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FprsfJIvMrERpUyMBgSQKgSpxrAx.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>调查人员于案发房屋门口献花</span></p><span></span><p><span>图片来源：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.tokyo-np.co.jp/article/77186" data-url="https://www.tokyo-np.co.jp/article/77186"><u><span>www.tokyo-np.co.jp</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://tablo.jp/archives/1848" data-url="https://tablo.jp/archives/1848"><u><span>tablo.jp</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.yomiuri.co.jp/pluralphoto/20231123-OYT1I50099/" data-url="https://www.yomiuri.co.jp/pluralphoto/20231123-OYT1I50099/"><u><span>www.yomiuri.co.jp</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.sankei.com/article/20211229-3SVYE2VCTJOALFD2PAODCR2PDM/?_trms=7bd38a4cbbf41dc9.1708968543768" data-url="https://www.sankei.com/article/20211229-3SVYE2VCTJOALFD2PAODCR2PDM/?_trms=7bd38a4cbbf41dc9.1708968543768"><u><span>www.sankei.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.buzzfeed.com/jp/naokoiwanaga/gennba-koukai" data-url="https://www.buzzfeed.com/jp/naokoiwanaga/gennba-koukai"><u><span>www.buzzfeed.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://vocus.cc/article/5d85dafcfd89780001394c5e" data-url="https://vocus.cc/article/5d85dafcfd89780001394c5e"><span>vocus.cc</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【联系】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>粉丝群，添加微信：tianjiakai，加你入群哦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家留言/发邮件/私信主播提供有趣的题材和故事，或者对我们的节目提出宝贵的建议，邮件请投递到echoinvestigation@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
